  "voiceover": [
    {
      "id": "P1",
      "scene": "S01",
      "start_s": 0.41,
      "end_s": 13.079,
      "ceiling_s": 13.98,
      "text": "Your people and agents see different truths. The truth is scattered across the systems where work happens. People rebuild it by hand. Agents start without it.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P1.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "P2",
      "scene": "S03",
      "start_s": 13.98,
      "end_s": 28.191,
      "ceiling_s": 28.86,
      "text": "Navis turns those signals into one shared understanding. Every email, meeting, document and message becomes a signal — remembered, connected, and turned into what should happen next.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P2.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "P3",
      "scene": "S05",
      "start_s": 28.86,
      "end_s": 51.064,
      "ceiling_s": 53.13,
      "text": "Inside a company, the Navis App is for people. It shows what changed — and why it matters. Every fact has its source, its time, and how fresh it is. When something needs a decision, Navis prepares the next step. A person decides. Then the company acts.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P3.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4",
      "scene": "S10",
      "start_s": 53.13,
      "end_s": 82.936,
      "ceiling_s": 83.52,
      "text": "The same company's agents use Navis Developer. Invite the team. Connect once — through MCP, API, SDK or CLI. The agent asks — and gets the company's context, with sources and freshness. Navis isn't the model. It supplies the company's truth. Every request is checked against its permissions. The agent does the work, and the run is on record.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P4.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "P5",
      "scene": "S16",
      "start_s": 83.52,
      "end_s": 97.078,
      "ceiling_s": 97.47,
      "text": "A solo builder gets a private workspace. A team can work together. And the work state carries into the next session. One company. The person and the agent acted on the same event.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P5.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "P6",
      "scene": "S17",
      "start_s": 97.47,
      "end_s": 104.079,
      "ceiling_s": 105.13,
      "text": "Same facts. Same sources. Same freshness. One understanding. Two ways in.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P6.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "P7",
      "scene": "S18",
      "start_s": 105.13,
      "end_s": 117.956,
      "ceiling_s": 118.77,
      "text": "Models change. Agents change. Tools change. What your company knows shouldn't have to start over. Company-owned. Model-neutral. Shared by people and agents.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P7.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "P8",
      "scene": "S18",
      "start_s": 118.77,
      "end_s": 123.838,
      "ceiling_s": 125.233,
      "text": "NavisLabs. The shared understanding for your organization.",
      "final": "voiceover/final/v6/P8.wav",
      "temp": "voiceover/final/v6/P8.wav"
    }
  ],
